  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Text Field Search\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. In `prompt.md`, plan how you want your search to work.\r\n\r\n3. Give your plan to AI and ask it to help you write the `titleSearch()` function.\r\n\r\n4. Your function should:\r\n\r\n   * reset `displayResources` to an empty array\r\n   * use `.map()` to go through each resource in `resources`\r\n   * use an `if` statement to decide which resources should be kept\r\n   * add matching resources to `displayResources`\r\n   * call `renderResources()` at the end\r\n\r\n5. Complete the `clearSearch()` function so it clears the input and shows all resources.\r\n\r\n6. Ask AI to suggest test cases to check your search. Try those tests in the app.\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
